	(text "Interface\n* Added 33pF on (R_BT) and (L_BT) Line\n\nAmplifier\n* Redesign Buffer stage\n* Changed DC Gain=2\n\nPower Management System\n* Use MOSFET as a switch to power up the module.\n* Changed BD50FA1FP3(5V Regulator) Pin Alignment\n\nBattery Management System\n* Increased ESD9L5.0ST5G Footprint size\n\n- Changed Alignment of Ref. Designators"
